:Mnemosyne a myth:Titan, myth:Female ; rdfs:label "Mnemosine"@it, "Mnemosyne"@en, "Μνημοσύνη"@grc .
:Phoebe    a myth:Titan, myth:Female ; rdfs:label "Febe"@it, "Phoebe"@en, "Φοίβη"@grc .
:Tethys    a myth:Titan, myth:Female ; rdfs:label "Teti (titanide)"@it, "Tethys"@en, "Τηθύς"@grc .
:Cronus    a myth:Titan, myth:Male ; rdfs:label "Crono"@it, "Cronus"@en, "Κρόνος"@grc .
:Atlas     a myth:Titan, myth:Male ; rdfs:label "Atlante"@it, "Atlas"@en, "Ἄτλας"@grc .
:Prometheus a myth:Titan, myth:Male ; rdfs:label "Prometeo"@it, "Prometheus"@en, "Προμηθεύς"@grc .
:Epimetheus a myth:Titan, myth:Male ; rdfs:label "Epimeteo"@it, "Epimetheus"@en, "Ἐπιμηθεύς"@grc .

