:Cerberus  a myth:Monster, myth:Male ; rdfs:label "Cerbero"@it, "Cerberus"@en, "Κέρβερος"@grc .
:Scylla    a myth:Monster, myth:Female ; rdfs:label "Scilla"@it, "Scylla"@en, "Σκύλλα"@grc .
